Verify:

- Remaining days until an event.
- Days elapsed in the current year.
- Days remaining in the current year.
- Current-day completion logic.
- Inclusive versus exclusive counting.
- Leap years.
- February 28 and February 29.
- December 31.
- January 1.
- Transitions across year boundaries.
- Events that occur today.
- Events in the past.
- Future events.
