## FINAL DIRECTIVE

The goal is not to make Dot Day look finished.

The goal is to make Dot Day behave correctly, retain data safely, update its real widget reliably, respond properly to every supported interaction, and continue working after restarts and configuration changes.

**Audit the existing implementation, identify actual root causes, fix them, test the fixes, and provide truthful evidence of the result.**

Correctness comes before cosmetics. Data safety comes before convenience. Verified functionality comes before feature count.

